{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1299,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c78655c2b7bd4e6ca998e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不是为了跟你打好关系\n才和你组队的。\n……好了，说说训练的话题吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9952fca145b264c304cb5339b4dd55b4cece80092ebf9df6f623b9e0330389d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f97a990514b3a5f97946e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってみせる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a17db497fe38ad60213894b8f1d2500836fc0eb571f4ca580a905b730c349743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db04d8a67a616d1b827f24a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更快……再快一些……！\n为了获胜，必须要再快些……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c49ad35a8ae6b06ef221c5749f15e9cc88bd7a0029b5729c73d8ca0830de7184",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:250430f94ab86ce9db065c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是训练，我也会全力奔跑。\n……因为她将能够奔跑的身体赠与了我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "481c2da962dcf1cab03b71b7945c93c247a26a3332af2d0f7fa43f3c178043b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d41a0a27f8763510ba7953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果没什么特别的指示的话，\n我就开始自主训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc90bcd4b4a881469a69aca8f9cc36b5026296a94a757ca6e6b5d7b1dfaadc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f993efe228425c2354cee65b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表面温度愈高，\n星星的表面也就越会显出蓝色。\n我的内心、我的愿望也——",
      "source_fingerprint": "755b2d0af64c09dbf25c35e7575959b3912dbb928b89b043ee30ffa4ce051ef8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6720bf0b3908d27a740be5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是低头的话，便永远看不见她的身影……\n所以，要向前……向上看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c63d94c4e228d708c162fa6cbba1b17757205e41b50f717ef2db71a484dcb451",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad26b0afb0743ab1f3b40f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与我竞争的对手是太阳也好，是月亮也罢……\n我已经下定决心，\n一定要为她献上不会输给任何人的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71defac6b42f3cb14a1ebe3a911a4522508e3ff8d8a7918c7a8ac2bb49c9ea0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1087eddc62dd6c97114380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……和夜晚的海滨截然不同，\n到处都吵吵嚷嚷的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d8d4f89b427ade90aa6270b4190227f2e5fee7364a914aca7cd610779170906",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7965ade8ccd180e05692ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是为了那个孩子，我都愿意。\n成为绝不会被任何人融化的——\n冰之女王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc307ed6c4db741d32a9034f0cc8bd0205bb6e0412f58805f9ae9aede5a111ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c53ded8826c0c42f834c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在雪道上锻炼耐力，\n一定也不错。如果要起个名字的话……\n也许可以叫做圣诞老人训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7d5b8303842517e0d5bb641f3d0109074669630dac2ff0ebb691b5550ecb25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6528bb5558c37de1765c9ec9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这胜利的礼物。\n一定要、由我……交给那孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03136bf8dafe2a1551a30e26092d96bfaa515c377142ea9d5b5ee30f9b112f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9911079d96bb95082ca5a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶紧开始吧。\n……和往常一样。你会\n支援我的，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57594311edb2a322ad43647666f706cde6d6a716ebb1e5f1e2535658d76a0899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752e0e2b7d21c81ff0384fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断奔跑。穿越寒冷刺骨的夜晚。\n必须对那孩子有所回报——\n因为，还没有开始融雪啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5277dbeee094de5f41daa24dc3f601e68847b38de14051320e71451e0e537ec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a214f8d0d4eeebc1c225250d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多么黑暗、没有星星的夜晚，  \n我都能够忍受。  \n只要这份愿望，还在我心中点亮着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d873733b440bee88dbb09300a4a634b0a5181adc65eef14718707d78b51f719b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5523fc3bfedd11af542bac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的手……大概像冰一样吧。\n即便如此，你还是握住了。\n明明随时都可以放开的……真傻啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5da4c5cb95dfbc7dbf2f760b0add445f303dbf11bd689aeb551b22593570ded",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8a230187abbfc6222ccecb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大概……多亏有你在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "137d1fea998951c6f7ab1883d50e76dbf0009849517cef772c298bb364e13d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df939d9c14c2b0d66b38ccf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……跑得……非常棒……\n我的心愿，是否有传达给她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c02f348109ca19e44107668c8d320963ad1aeed42613d5ccc533c22384a6869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5d84183415d271b64cedc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "照亮雪夜的月亮。……那就是你啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c802daad38b646149749f1d5cbb7aab5101d789c183e3d532ee4ee2363fe53f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd3d270654f34e97cd9cc57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连感受寒冷的时间都没有呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c9b84d0bc21fbe9718af312806d3c7c6bf6deccd1e965b7f8ccb3b3585e01a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad2be9d929ecfbf6a672a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有这份力量的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f19c696195a74ea8acef8fb45278c0427c54e331157e918809af13e676e88ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b61ed4a0b8d1ef4480beb2fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断将手伸向前方的话，\n终有一日……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e45bc36c935127c7b6cf1e67f24cea6b06be8e73d2b22edb32e89218b83280b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a11e3faed859696c182ec54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……爱慕织姬。快点开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5b2f779ac253855004bf670448cf4f69fe7f386a0fe7652de0f6b168afe5d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266d7b85ee48a0c468ba13cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用这双脚……亲自赢下献给她的星星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e91c98fd4b0ad986fecfbdd69b6a6820d7566104a12afdecf853381dd79d028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb3a348f6ed448ed1639102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像比起过去，变的更强了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "15852b163f45f5f57adc28e1f37f246cb669ccf22f4510a7c5944a60d27be3c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43dfd6e0ca74b574a51d97f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会辜负期待……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bbf08bd01fd2cead2a454232862a5e34b6dc095ff06c99b7984b0ff6384fd3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8ae26ca773c90380d9f90c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像壁炉一样，好暖和……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe642066023d902980d1502debcda3170d6aaa285d95db42c6a143a127d724c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71bda991a192ea9045abb57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的话，连奇迹也……",
      "source_fingerprint": "11cbff4e75512777bf53bfbd4a0b0e32e883bb534317c1097986dcce26301c96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8745e56bbaa849718f460b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，开拓道路吧。  \n为了我，也为了我的同胞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af95cff63e5f7f98b79d18cec2a30f06b1c8a62561fecd27563ddcbbc996e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7596dd4373ab7456966c2e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…爱慕织姬。\n…即使是暴风雪，我也会跨越。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d52ee9903b3cd78b139603ffe3116e0afc9cd5fc6a98be320c028331f548c00b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0edd4e48bbfde544c424dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a88406725e73ba91796c1f34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管怎么说，你还是带我\r\n登上了有趣的舞台。\r\n你真是个了不起又讨喜的人呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8716fc1dd0ac5eb53515c47739fdb1b0111bfe54f0df84967c8d3abfaa4f8f7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473681525de66405760c3f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dff48f1da859e52a685f16896f34008da7a843350e60cd751d1f26011c52110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b555ba64327c415007ad5dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb71f9f47646c99c1c92b1a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托你的福，我才能尽情和强大的\r\n赛马娘进行热血的较量。\r\n嘿嘿，真是太感谢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67a40e6ebedd351c8e9c4c6930aa79c7a9c504da423658fb557e60bf5a39791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aedf148ed614a368bd87084a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要好好和搭档同心协力，\r\n就不会独自冲过头。\r\n嘿嘿，真是可靠呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86af8a73b449d1795f2b40bda3286c7beb5a975e87f1dbeb376dc77e97602d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0a9d14709c37ca1385eabbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然新年在家好好休息也不错，\r\n但我果然还是坐不住！\r\n要不要一起打板羽球？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab5da1e73e266792bf999a7fea62adf2424a96b3105769041873651e1947308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ce858976fab88ccca5cf4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我常去的日式点心店，\r\n推出了巧克力日式馒头。\r\n一起吃吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bed02ab521c92bdc1da82e0bcb9202a2f9ea396142e577dce185f68cb788616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f497e643e58b8f4c61ab3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然比不上专业的师傅，\r\n但我还是做好了一个！\r\n尽情享用甜点吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "470efddbcf9897b22513c021e6b23238fb5fb75deed124d4f6abe63e36a3954b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ffa43c3165beefbf1c5c92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街上多了许多竹子，机会难得，\r\n我也想写个大愿望，\r\n挂在那种高高的竹子上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0845f264baa01c0d2fd6b6a06ab3dc41e1fb1c14ab59dd8449d4f88d615f80b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109e2900176435cddc7e09fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街上正因为万圣节而非常热闹。\r\n我也打扮成稻荷神的样子，\r\n去街上逛逛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1aeb64e712c0be7004689e5f566d72700cd371c31f1365f3e8f57404c6be77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b6315bc2c336eb5103cabb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会送好孩子们礼物的圣诞老人──\r\n或许意外地适合在以人情为主题的\r\n歌舞伎中登场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f998c3936f41e7baa9994e8635b37a4dd636bf44a53351bca60a3b2e43fef709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f4cbecf2ff353096586f62e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然讲出来就不潇洒了，\r\n但也不能忘记。\r\n我在你桌上放了好东西喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270b810dbad5bab16121129735eb3d46207bda73e970ba4f35a3c546f8a9f453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6d9c278de93fcf60f20a22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，怎么样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09f48ecf72a90c17b6b4b8e2254e31f8212027c3f3f98e71911205e35992691",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9f6441476faef99b143fa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔，跨年荞麦面准备好了吗？\r\n沾味道浓厚的酱汁，\r\n大口吃下去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a41b608133977b638fbb1c1d73f8fb2533a7d048ece1750847eeeed7a15149e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94f4ac433231a12051244633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的大好日子吧。\r\n别那么见外，\r\n乖乖让我替你庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13283df86e0eb38a2fa44576f54bb2f43b1ebb7ba34374e656ace3c1e40e645f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d5669bde3ef601b17d1f26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大肆庆祝也不错，\r\n但像这样两人一起吃豆皮寿司庆祝，\r\n也是一种潇洒吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4aea6415001132d9b7d6a3304336d01c5a0152ac531731d97fa6ded15f29001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c91d107e055250a7f47646",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年家乡的人都会在这一天\r\n替我庆祝……哎呀，\r\n好像有东西跑进眼睛里了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbaf1d6e39a4fc49acfc1334ef55217a4e053f9c2ca086637410b1f6ae399ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8157d1cd72b2290fb63ca60e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日！\r\n怎么样，\r\n要不要豪迈地订个寿司啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b66764a7a3c0676a04f774f6601de2a456c9c3d992ff76793de5ef348359eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3195b246f0c897e0f5ac999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告喔？\r\n这种时候还是去看一下写了什么吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af1c2f8462c4ce1e0ff510c56e14178c7122585e63f5471e3a09c6dacea3e3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2846fb19c9655e0f791c6623",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，好像有礼物呢！\r\n来看一下内容吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e23da139270e312326a2f111b35274d2dcf2a0b8391e7a07f58bb7883e31a33a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd2d702c94870913a5a4332d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好像达成了叫任务的东西！\r\n挺厉害的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad72d11356c07478c4009f555cf0e1f02dcae27402e15401222c1bf6a4a84aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65cedc478dd9ab283f211b42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近要举办一场很盛大的祭典喔！\r\n嘿嘿，我的身体开始蠢蠢欲动了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "246a07f69c4cb536d70348819e89427281b590541fdcbfd83239514dd1eb1875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2edbc85c397b400897141669",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔，祭典开始了！\r\n得让你见识一下\r\n稻荷大人豪迈的身影才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3738b964fdefb9548edcec59198249e8f2cb645109120d98bb5f34ea2521bfee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da5bb7cc17ac509304da7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061f1c94e7ce02bf5dbddb0ebde91aba45d2704a1d015f3c9c3b989d322eee63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad04ef5cfc65fd779649ad8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n似乎提升了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b4bc23ec80a4d90d3c97b67989e61e838712d131b731f4f9f254984160e553e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b2928b8c70685b2e31faba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "びびっと来る鮮やかな色、\r\n特に紫が好きでねえ。服でも\r\nなんでもつい紫にしちまうな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6e14b81209269329c1bb629de2e4eaca08e9dab7395b5e1d96477334f12f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b7d4dd90e078870085b202",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この腰のリボンかい？…へへ、\r\n粋だろ？大井の子分が『姐さんに\r\n似合う』ってくれたのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe38dda0a41aaaa1a49d1a78fd783e0d506fdecd02dd93b475b4082da754eba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3c6cbe804b11aea8be503b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "銭湯のロッカーは\r\n『いなせ』な番号、177番が\r\nイナリ様の定位置でい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b216f6f5b8c2635388b467199d26c2fb1250a33962efa14a890f73db51a69988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ada2288a14961c8586e4a65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b006d30655de8bf61a4acc65f209794ac0c1189cea0b19bf85a09590a16e5a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2878d8bd46cd7747d3a9b00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大概就这样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d135fec0b32fc2cd5598d5052f13e2a955093cf2b68b0552d7e4629aac926164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6469612ce4a76ed7d19c46b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061f1c94e7ce02bf5dbddb0ebde91aba45d2704a1d015f3c9c3b989d322eee63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f3802ba2b094d2e184cab6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b006d30655de8bf61a4acc65f209794ac0c1189cea0b19bf85a09590a16e5a84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c944059893da6255edc6605",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放个烟火庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e19ca7ef7610b7d57297512dff7f1f294640bc208aad935ae11d875d85d0df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b821d40db94cfc32bd9d1adc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b123d718a3a2e29402c75bbaa91ea7a4d9cd9e8c9a1e1148f7bd9d637bcf53b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1a0cf4098f8ed05a0c5e083",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的背后就交给你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a0fbcfa188578298ce06b9ccfbe8d93c138b2ce3226b3f3045cb37e9e3a9a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aac407d0d3d97f8206a701b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爽快地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea423538c09ce9e9427178ecb9ddc574582cc66262b59add6c7b9e9f567266d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb3e345686c42f14e09c88d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c24fee2dd0fb0dfe1b7c6f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要锻炼啊。\r\n真是勤奋呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d04892a6bf1ff1d974b606873ba28861b585f5ca8a304144a8686dda47732db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40155bd49c8b733703f306f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史啊。\r\n毕竟传统也很重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86969fb1b6adb779d5e64b39a37bc29e69b65beb52578eab6991b3f068972fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896032bfa2d42e15fae31f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔，想挑战比赛吗？\r\n很好，真是豪迈呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7743c9cc5ee4aa28a4fb1a4ddeef4abbb898fbf498e6c17a130dfc9dc65fb349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99ebc599308b74c2dfdef975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff23f287dc7bea1138f1e419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的是如虎添翼呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd36a7fe332122d0797110ccf537900dd366d7dcee9781300d542e29b38ab34e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffbdb3af9594ea4b7476687f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7e857511d8f5ef5f0fe68a705513be25e1f03293e446e5e256a36a024e0569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8751facf5f2be44d830341da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输赢就看胆识！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56cb1015437ddafafa8ca9286cc499e87442f4491f7332bd4ce0b7c17c33ef7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b5040ebc0ebeca520b533aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你挺行的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0abfdd56dfbede0d9e5cddfbaef67c670b5f8d5d6df7572492f171235b076d2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c941cb015370a5663fb65b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重新再来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd6b4fde24e720868129e9ffb551ef94689f24b21670421701eac36f0dda6749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89bbdf6314e03f390f71ee32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大丰收呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f918eaccc1f231c80485124a7ff9f066098bec90c125aedabb02a39cdef0a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d181b396595c758d4a8b54b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况不错嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc15474264079dc0cfa141aa7fc51b3116b108464c68651b21fe14c3e990a3ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1034",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9307eca9c065d2f32536c335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打起精神来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4429653afa9c566a8ee4b5570ccc37845bb0303b4074707626aff4a4d5541d",
